      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<section class=\"sr-journal sr-handout\"><p class=\"sr-eyebrow\">STILLROOT'S SONG &nbsp; | &nbsp; PLAYER HANDOUT</p><h1>The first voice</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>One spear upon a brow of white,</p>\n<p>Four hooves that flee the hunter's sight.</p>\n<p>No soldier I, though crowned for war;</p>\n<p>What woodland wonder bears no more?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</section>"
